---

This package (next_gen_scrapy) extracts field coordinates from NFL Next Gen Stats chart images
using a from-scratch computer-vision pipeline. It follows in the spirit of the original
next-gen-scrapy project by Sarah Mallepalle and collaborators at Carnegie Mellon University
(https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.03339) and its route/carry extensions by Arrowhead Analytics - see
README.md for full credits - but shares no code with either; this license covers only the code in
this repository.
